{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 41, :comments ["<b>And you said.</b> ואמרתם הן — do not wonder how a verb can be derived from a particle (מלה מדבקת), for so too the words על, גם, and פן, as we find אפונה, as I explained. And some say it is from the root הן, the meaning being 'measure,' but that is far-fetched."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:21:57.259580852Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}